  "description": "Hammond with maximum instability — the tonewheel generator wobbling unpredictably. Fast LFO1 flutter, slow LFO2 drawbar morphing. CHARACTER at 0.5 (above default). MOVEMENT at 0.9 (well above default). Notes shift character over their sustain in ways that cannot be predicted. The organ that sounds different the second time you play the same chord.",
